[I] Client library for accessing NFS shares

[T] LIBNFS is a client library for accessing NFS shares over a network,
[T] supporting NFSv3 and NFSv4. It offers a raw RPC API, an asynchronous and
[T] a synchronous POSIX-like API, and comes with small utilities like nfs-ls
[T] and nfs-cp.

[U] https://github.com/sahlberg/libnfs

[A] Libnfs Authors
